  "reason": "The best configuration so far is config_031 (scvi_n200 + resnet50 + multiprofile + avgpool + weighted, 0.678 acc). The strongest single improvement came from switching RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 (+4%), and weighted fusion + avgpool aggregation are confirmed as the best choices. However, the image encoder dimension remains untested with scvi_n200: with pca_n2000, resnet50 (0.639) and imagenet_vit_l (0.635) were nearly tied, but the interaction with the richer scvi_n200 representation is unknown. Config_037 (scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + multiprofile + avgpool + weighted) is a clean single-variable change from the best config, directly testing whether a larger image encoder better complements the improved RNA features. This is the most informative next step because it either identifies a new best configuration or confirms resnet50 is sufficient, allowing subsequent experiments to focus on the remaining unexplored dimension (scgpt encoder) with confidence about the image branch."
}

